{
  "_readme": "Concept -> service registry for deterministic disambiguation. Built from the four-corpus concept analysis. 'services' maps each service to display labels (per language) and keywords that identify it in a query. 'concepts' maps each cross-service concept to the services that GENUINELY have it (never spurious word-collisions) plus keywords that identify the concept. Disambiguation logic: if a query names a service -> scope to it; else detect concepts, intersect their service sets -> if >=2 services remain and none is named, ask which one (offering only those); if exactly 1 remains, scope to it; if none, answer best-match. Keywords are matched case-insensitively as substrings against the raw query (English + Bangla + common Banglish spellings). Tune keywords as you test.",

